{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/focusmode

    The reduced page shell of focus mode.

    A copy of Boost Union's own drawers layout with the chrome removed, rendered from the
    very same context: Boost Union's layout file runs unchanged and this theme's core
    renderer only swaps the template name on the way past, so every Boost Union setting
    keyed on the incourse layout keeps resolving and nothing is switched off server-side.

    Kept from the original, and each for a reason worth knowing before removing it:

    * The Boost head partial, the toast wrapper and the standard top of body html, which is
      where core prints its own skip link to the main content anchor.
    * The course index drawer and the block drawer, verbatim, with their toggles. The block
      drawer holds side-pre, the one region core declares for this layout, and it is where a
      book's table of contents, a quiz's question navigation and a lesson's menu live.
    * The page, main-inner, page-content, region-main-box and region-main ids, which core's
      own CSS and JavaScript select on.
    * The core activity header partial, which emits the main content anchor. Its title arrives
      empty from core (Boost declares activityheaderconfig notitle), so the name is not announced
      twice, and its activity information render arrives replaced by the activity description
      alone - the box is the only place that description appears, so blanking it outright would
      take away content rather than chrome. Nothing is disabled server-side, which is what keeps
      the manual completion button in the page's header actions and therefore in the bar.
    * The Boost Union footer partial, which is what emits the end of body token. Without it
      the page ships with no JavaScript at all, silently.

    Dropped: the navbar, the smart menus, the offcanvas drawer, the full header with its
    breadcrumb, the secondary navigation row, the tertiary overflow, the region main
    settings menu, every extra Boost Union block region, the slider, the advertisement
    tiles and the footnote. A future revision which hides the tabs server-side instead must
    pair that with hiding the settings menu, or Boost Union's own expression turns the
    settings cog on.

    Context variables required for this template (described without braces, because a
    Mustache comment closes at the first pair of closing braces it meets):

    * bodyattributes - the body tag attributes, carrying the focus mode body classes
    * output - the core renderer of the page
    * focusbar - the bar sub-context, documented in the focusmode_bar template
    * courseindex - the rendered course index, empty on a format which uses none
    * courseindexopen, blockdraweropen, forceblockdraweropen - the drawer states
    * hasblocks, sidepreblocks, addblockbutton - the block drawer's content
    * headercontent - the exported activity header, its title empty as Boost exports it and its
      completion replaced by the rendered focusmode_description template
    * focuscompletion - false, or an object with istrackeduser and completiondetails
    * courserelatedhints - Boost Union's course related hints
    * infobannersabove, infobannersbelow - the administrator's info banners
    * sitename - the site short name, used by the head partial

    Example context (json):
    {
        "sitename": "Acme",
        "bodyattributes": "id=\"page-mod-page-view\" class=\"dimensions-focusmode pagelayout-incourse\"",
        "output": {
            "doctype": "<!DOCTYPE html>",
            "page_title": "Sinais vitais",
            "favicon": "favicon.ico",
            "standard_top_of_body_html": "<a class=\"visually-hidden-focusable\" href=\"#maincontent\">Skip to main content</a>",
            "main_content": "<h2>Headings make html validators happier</h2>",
            "course_content_header_notifications": "",
            "course_content_header_coursecontent": "",
            "course_content_footer": "",
            "focusmode_activity_navigation": "<div class=\"activity-navigation\">Next</div>",
            "standard_after_main_region_html": ""
        },
        "focusbar": {
            "navbarcolorclasses": "bg-primary",
            "databstheme": "dark",
            "coursename": "APH-2026",
            "closeurl": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=2#module-4",
            "title": "Sinais vitais",
            "headeractions": [],
            "expanded": false,
            "widthlabel": "Wide reading column",
            "hasmore": false,
            "moreitems": [],
            "editswitch": "",
            "leaveform": false,
            "actionurl": "https://example.com/theme/dimensions/focus.php",
            "sesskey": "AbC123dEf4",
            "cmid": 4,
            "closelabel": "Exit focus mode",
            "closetitle": "Back to the course"
        },
        "courseindex": "<div class=\"courseindex\">Course index</div>",
        "courseindexopen": true,
        "hasblocks": true,
        "sidepreblocks": "<section data-block=\"html\">Blocks html goes here</section>",
        "addblockbutton": "",
        "blockdraweropen": true,
        "forceblockdraweropen": false,
        "headercontent": {
            "title": "",
            "completion": "<div class=\"activity-description dimensions-focus-description\" id=\"intro\">Read the protocol before the session.</div>"
        },
        "focuscompletion": {
            "istrackeduser": true,
            "completiondetails": [
                {"statusincomplete": 1, "description": "View"}
            ]
        },
        "courserelatedhints": "",
        "infobannersabove": [
            {
                "content": "Lorem ipsum",
                "bsclass": "primary",
                "no": 1,
                "dismissible": false
            }
        ],
        "infobannersbelow": []
    }
}}
{{> theme_boost/head }}

<body {{{ bodyattributes }}}>
{{> core/local/toast/wrapper}}
<div id="page-wrapper" class="d-print-block">

    {{{ output.standard_top_of_body_html }}}

    {{#focusbar}}
        {{> theme_dimensions/focusmode_bar }}
    {{/focusbar}}

    {{#courseindex}}
        {{< theme_boost/drawer }}
            {{$id}}theme_boost-drawers-courseindex{{/id}}
            {{$drawerheading}}{{> theme_boost/courseindexdrawerheading}}{{/drawerheading}}
            {{$drawercontrols}}{{> theme_boost/courseindexdrawercontrols}}{{/drawercontrols}}
            {{$drawerclasses}}drawer drawer-left {{#courseindexopen}}show{{/courseindexopen}}{{/drawerclasses}}
            {{$drawercontent}}
                {{{courseindex}}}
            {{/drawercontent}}
            {{$drawerpreferencename}}drawer-open-index{{/drawerpreferencename}}
            {{$drawerstate}}show-drawer-left{{/drawerstate}}
            {{$tooltipplacement}}right{{/tooltipplacement}}
            {{$closebuttontext}}{{#str}}closecourseindex, core{{/str}}{{/closebuttontext}}
            {{$closebuttonicon}}
                <span class="dir-rtl-hide">{{#pix}} e/sidebar_left, core {{/pix}}</span>
                <span class="dir-ltr-hide">{{#pix}} e/sidebar_right, core {{/pix}}</span>
            {{/closebuttonicon}}
        {{/ theme_boost/drawer}}
    {{/courseindex}}
    {{#hasblocks}}
        {{< theme_boost/drawer }}
            {{$id}}theme_boost-drawers-blocks{{/id}}
            {{$drawerclasses}}drawer drawer-right{{#blockdraweropen}} show{{/blockdraweropen}}{{/drawerclasses}}
            {{$drawercontent}}
                <div class="d-print-none">
                    {{{ addblockbutton }}}
                    {{{ sidepreblocks }}}
                </div>
            {{/drawercontent}}
            {{$drawerpreferencename}}drawer-open-block{{/drawerpreferencename}}
            {{$forceopen}}{{#forceblockdraweropen}}1{{/forceblockdraweropen}}{{/forceopen}}
            {{$drawerstate}}show-drawer-right{{/drawerstate}}
            {{$tooltipplacement}}left{{/tooltipplacement}}
            {{$drawercloseonresize}}1{{/drawercloseonresize}}
            {{$closebuttontext}}{{#str}}closeblockdrawer, core{{/str}}{{/closebuttontext}}
            {{$closebuttonicon}}
                <span class="dir-rtl-hide">{{#pix}} e/sidebar_right, core {{/pix}}</span>
                <span class="dir-ltr-hide">{{#pix}} e/sidebar_left, core {{/pix}}</span>
            {{/closebuttonicon}}
        {{/ theme_boost/drawer}}
    {{/hasblocks}}

    <div id="page" data-region="mainpage" data-usertour="scroller" class="drawers {{#courseindexopen}}show-drawer-left{{/courseindexopen}} {{#blockdraweropen}}show-drawer-right{{/blockdraweropen}} drag-container">
        <div id="topofscroll" class="main-inner">
            <div class="drawer-toggles d-flex">
                {{#courseindex}}
                    <div class="drawer-toggler drawer-left-toggle open-nav d-print-none">
                        <button
                            class="btn btn-icon icon-size-3"
                            data-toggler="drawers"
                            data-action="toggle"
                            data-target="theme_boost-drawers-courseindex"
                            data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                            data-bs-placement="right"
                            title="{{#str}}opendrawerindex, core{{/str}}"
                        >
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}opendrawerindex, core{{/str}}</span>
                            <span class="dir-rtl-hide">{{#pix}} e/sidebar_left, core {{/pix}}</span>
                            <span class="dir-ltr-hide">{{#pix}} e/sidebar_right, core {{/pix}}</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                {{/courseindex}}
                {{#hasblocks}}
                    <div class="drawer-toggler drawer-right-toggle ms-auto d-print-none">
                        <button
                            class="btn btn-icon icon-size-3"
                            data-toggler="drawers"
                            data-action="toggle"
                            data-target="theme_boost-drawers-blocks"
                            data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                            data-bs-placement="right"
                            title="{{#str}}opendrawerblocks, core{{/str}}"
                        >
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}opendrawerblocks, core{{/str}}</span>
                            <span class="dir-rtl-hide">{{#pix}} e/sidebar_right, core {{/pix}}</span>
                            <span class="dir-ltr-hide">{{#pix}} e/sidebar_left, core {{/pix}}</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                {{/hasblocks}}
            </div>
            {{> theme_boost_union/javascriptdisabledhint }}
            {{> theme_boost_union/infobannersabove }}
            {{> theme_boost_union/infobannersbelow }}
            {{{ output.course_content_header_notifications }}}
            <div id="page-content" class="pb-3 d-print-block">
                <div id="region-main-box">
                    <div id="region-main">
                        {{{ output.course_content_header_coursecontent }}}
                        {{#headercontent}}
                            {{> core/activity_header }}
                        {{/headercontent}}
                        {{{courserelatedhints}}}
                        {{{ output.main_content }}}
                        {{#focuscompletion}}
                            <div class="dimensions-focus-completion">
                                <span class="dimensions-focus-completion-kicker">{{#str}}focusmode_completionkicker, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
                                <ul class="dimensions-focus-completion-list">
                                    {{#completiondetails}}
                                        {{> core_course/completion_automatic }}
                                    {{/completiondetails}}
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        {{/focuscompletion}}
                        <div class="dimensions-focus-activitynav">
                            {{{ output.focusmode_activity_navigation }}}
                        </div>
                        {{{ output.course_content_footer }}}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {{> theme_boost/footer }}
    </div>
    {{{ output.standard_after_main_region_html }}}
</div>

</body>
</html>
{{#js}}
M.util.js_pending('theme_boost/loader');
require(['theme_boost/loader', 'theme_boost/drawer'], function(Loader, Drawer) {
    Drawer.init();
    M.util.js_complete('theme_boost/loader');
});
{{/js}}
